::: {.callout-important title="Sample ID Convention"}
eDNA sample IDs follow the pattern: `ps_station_id_r###`

- `PNG_2024_edna_001_10m_r001` — First replicate at 10m station
- `PNG_2024_edna_001_10m_r002` — Second replicate at same station  
- `PNG_2024_edna_001_20m_r001` — First replicate at deeper station

This ensures traceability from site → station → individual sample for laboratory processing and analysis.
:::
